    "Configure type, initial value and persistence. Changes are saved with the flow. Runtime values are written to flash approximately every 5 seconds.": "Configure type, initial value and persistence. Changes are saved with the flow. Runtime values are written to flash approximately every 5 seconds.",
    "Typ, Anfangswert und dauerhafte Speicherung festlegen. Änderungen werden mit dem Ablauf gespeichert. Laufzeitwerte werden etwa alle 5 Sekunden in den Flash geschrieben.": "Configure type, initial value and persistence. Changes are saved with the flow. Runtime values are written to flash approximately every 5 seconds.",
    "Map each /win XML field to a variable. Repeated fields such as cl (RGB): index 0, 1 or 2. All mappings are applied together.": "Map each /win XML field to a variable. Repeated fields such as cl (RGB): index 0, 1 or 2. All mappings are applied together.",
